/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Loot</strong>\u00a0is everywhere. Farm\u00a0<strong>Equipment</strong>\u00a0to bolster your <strong>Rebels</strong>\u00a0to give yourself a head start on your future Raids. <br><strong>Bandages</strong>, <strong>Keys</strong>, <strong>Currencies</strong> and valuable <strong>Souvenirs</strong> can be found across all Raids.<br><strong>Sell</strong>\u00a0it, <strong>Use</strong>\u00a0it, or <strong>Stash</strong>\u00a0it back home at\u00a0<strong>The Liberator</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352240/extras/61b4162fb8a6df4e82b8649ed216e95f.poster.avif?t=1765816920\" width=1170 height=328 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352240/extras/61b4162fb8a6df4e82b8649ed216e95f.webm?t=1765816920\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352240/extras/61b4162fb8a6df4e82b8649ed216e95f.mp4?t=1765816920\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3352240/extras/8f20f9ccc69d27f048bc6ef7bd1e1788.avif?t=1765816920\" width=780 height=237 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We are in it for the long haul! We are working like crazy to bring you the best game we can - and we need your feedback to do it. <br>Balance issues, Suggestions, Feature Ideas - we wanna hear it all.<br><br> Join us on <strong>Discord</strong> and in <strong>Early Access</strong>\u00a0to help us shape <strong>Raiders of Blackveil</strong> as we grow!  </p>","developers":["Wombo Games"],"genres":[{"description":"Action","id":"1"},{"description":"Early Access","id":"70"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/ap